            "review_title": "Review at Ba Le",
            "review_text": "Nick\nLos Angeles, California122 contributions\n0\nGreat local banh mi stand.\nJul 2023\nGreat local banh mi stand. A friend who lives in Nha Trang took me here as his favorite sandwich place. There are two options, a meat pate option and a caramelized fish (ca koh) option. My friends favorite is the fish but I preferred the regular because the pate was great and tasted fresh. Great cheap eats stop.\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 24, 2023",
